{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/logo_sans_fond.png?t=1743170108\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once again, these pathetic humans have survived the apocalypse. But not this time.<br>You are the dark mind behind history\u2019s greatest monster invasions, and now it\u2019s time to finish what you started. Take control of your minions, turn the tide, and wipe humanity off the map. They think they can fight back? Show them what a real threat looks like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Possess your minions</strong> and control them directly to slaughter as many humans as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Three unique environments</strong>, each filled with deadly traps and relentless enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrades and synergies</strong> to customize your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crush humanity\u2019s greatest heroes</strong> and make an example of them.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Massacre hordes of humans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do these weak creatures really think they can rule for much longer? Harness the power of your possessed monsters, unlock devastating abilities, and make sure not a single human escapes alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/GIF_-_Fight.gif?t=1743170108\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build your ultimate loadout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run gives you the chance to experiment with unique upgrades. Acquire powerful singularities, unlock new passives, and fine-tune your strategy to turn your creatures into unstoppable killing machines. Every choice can mean the difference between total domination\u2026 or another attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/GIF_-_build.gif?t=1743170108\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face their so-called &quot;heroes&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanity won\u2019t go down without a fight\u2014they\u2019re sending their strongest warriors to stop you. Elite soldiers, valkyries, and legendary fighters will stand in your way. It\u2019s up to you to crush their last hope for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/GIF_-_Boss.gif?t=1743170108\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498680?t=1743170108","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/7b7335abee40042eec714f6958af3cfb1ae5aa4c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743170108","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/8d1ddf35459bc6e35b6f60ae567bb242a3327eb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743170108","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/8d1ddf35459bc6e35b6f60ae567bb242a3327eb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743170108","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/logo_sans_fond.png?t=1743170108\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once again, these pathetic humans have survived the apocalypse. But not this time.<br>You are the dark mind behind history\u2019s greatest monster invasions, and now it\u2019s time to finish what you started. Take control of your minions, turn the tide, and wipe humanity off the map. They think they can fight back? Show them what a real threat looks like!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Possess your minions</strong> and control them directly to slaughter as many humans as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Three unique environments</strong>, each filled with deadly traps and relentless enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrades and synergies</strong> to customize your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crush humanity\u2019s greatest heroes</strong> and make an example of them.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Massacre hordes of humans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do these weak creatures really think they can rule for much longer? Harness the power of your possessed monsters, unlock devastating abilities, and make sure not a single human escapes alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/GIF_-_Fight.gif?t=1743170108\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build your ultimate loadout</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run gives you the chance to experiment with unique upgrades. Acquire powerful singularities, unlock new passives, and fine-tune your strategy to turn your creatures into unstoppable killing machines. Every choice can mean the difference between total domination\u2026 or another attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/GIF_-_build.gif?t=1743170108\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face their so-called &quot;heroes&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanity won\u2019t go down without a fight\u2014they\u2019re sending their strongest warriors to stop you. Elite soldiers, valkyries, and legendary fighters will stand in your way. It\u2019s up to you to crush their last hope for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/extras/GIF_-_Boss.gif?t=1743170108\" /></p>","developers":["Mastodonte"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498680/304acc4b3575cfdad1d89490966a81e104edf4ae/header.jpg?t=1743170108","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Game developed and published by Mastodonte (France).","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119485,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119485/movie480.mp4?t=1743170105","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119485/movie_max.mp4?t=1743170105"},"name":"Early Access SUMMER 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119485/4cc50575ac3776a2143778289d32a9c763beaf33/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743170105","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119485/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743170105","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119485/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743170105"}}],"name":"The Mindvasion","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 Cores / 2.5 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 970 / AMD RX 570<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4 Cores / 3.5 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1070 / AMD R